'''Witch Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. She was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] increases her range, health and the duration of her Slow. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Witch Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

